---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Un-Tilted — live events from Ryzo Studios"
  description="A live session where kids watch the film, play the game, then draw what anger actually feels like and say it out loud."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="ut-hero">
    <div class="ut-hero-bg">
      <!-- PLACEHOLDER: Sticky-note wall or photo of kids in the room -->
      <div class="ut-hero-placeholder" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ut-hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="container ut-hero-content">
      <span class="eyebrow">The Live Event</span>
      <h1 class="display">
        Un-<span class="accent-text">Tilted</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="ut-hero-desc">
        Kids watch the film, play the game, then pick up a Sharpie and draw
        what anger actually feels like. Then they share it out loud.
      </p>
      <div class="ut-hero-stats">
        <span>16 sessions</span>
        <span class="stat-sep">&middot;</span>
        <span>5 states and DC</span>
        <span class="stat-sep">&middot;</span>
        <span>248 drawings</span>
      </div>
      <a href="mailto:hello@ryzo.studio?subject=UN-TILTED%20INQUIRY" class="btn btn-primary">Bring Un-Tilted to Your Community</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What happens in the room -->
  <section class="section ut-room-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="ut-room-grid">
        <div class="ut-room-text">
          <span class="eyebrow">What Happens in the Room</span>
          <h2 class="subheadline">What happens in the room.</h2>
          <p class="body-lg ut-callout">Aaron's tools are a sticky note and a Sharpie. So are ours.</p>
          <p class="body-lg">
            Every session runs the same three moves. Kids watch Release the Beast.
            They play Rage Fighters. And along the way they draw.
          </p>
          <p class="body-lg">
            They start by drawing the last time they got angry. Then they talk about
            what was underneath it, and pick a skill for the next time it happens.
          </p>
          <p class="body-lg">
            The drawing comes before the talking, on purpose. It's easier to hand
            someone a picture than to say the sentence out loud, and once the picture
            is on the table the sentence tends to follow.
          </p>
          <p class="body-lg">
            We drop one piece of insight into the room partway through: anger never
            comes alone. Then we ask what else was there. Boys drew embarrassed,
            left out, small, unseen. Two in five landed on a word that named the
            feeling underneath the anger.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="ut-room-image">
          <!-- PLACEHOLDER: Photo of kids drawing / session in action -->
          <div class="image-placeholder">
            <span>Session photo</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Quotes -->
  <section class="section ut-quotes-section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">What Facilitators Told Us</span>
      <div class="ut-quotes-grid">
        <blockquote class="ut-quote">
          <p>"That boy comes every week. I've never heard him share. Today he talked about his feelings, shared a picture, and told us about something in his life that was challenging."</p>
          <footer>Museum programmer, Oakland, CA</footer>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote class="ut-quote">
          <p>"They were more attentive to this film and game than anything we've ever done. I've never seen the boys share like this, especially about their emotions."</p>
          <footer>After-school facilitator, Denver, CO</footer>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Photo break -->
  <section class="ut-photo-break">
    <!-- PLACEHOLDER: Full-width photo of drawings on the wall / kids in action -->
    <div class="image-placeholder image-placeholder-wide">
      <span>Full-width session photo</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Formats -->
  <section class="section ut-formats-section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Formats</span>
      <h2 class="subheadline">Built for your room.</h2>
      <div class="ut-formats-grid">
        <div class="ut-format-card">
          <!-- PLACEHOLDER: Photo of kids in session -->
          <div class="image-placeholder image-placeholder-card">
            <span>Kids session photo</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ut-format-title">Kids, Ages 10 and Up</h3>
          <p>The full combination: animation, gaming, and art in a single live session.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ut-format-card">
          <!-- PLACEHOLDER: Photo of adult session / talk -->
          <div class="image-placeholder image-placeholder-card">
            <span>Adult session photo</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ut-format-title">Adults and Tinkerers</h3>
          <p>How story and impact get built together inside a digital-first production. Real talk for people who make things.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ut-format-card">
          <!-- PLACEHOLDER: Festival screening photo -->
          <div class="image-placeholder image-placeholder-card">
            <span>Festival photo</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ut-format-title">Festivals</h3>
          <p>A short film with a conversation worth having afterward.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Where we've been -->
  <section class="section ut-where-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="ut-where-grid">
        <div class="ut-where-image">
          <!-- PLACEHOLDER: Collage or map of venues -->
          <div class="image-placeholder">
            <span>Venues photo</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ut-where-text">
          <span class="eyebrow">Where We've Been</span>
          <h2 class="subheadline">Where we've been.</h2>
          <p class="body-lg ut-venues">
            The Clubhouse Network &middot; The MADE Oakland &middot; Boys & Girls Club Teen Center
            of San Leandro &middot; MACLA San Jose &middot; Best Buy Teen Tech Centers &middot;
            Gold Crown Foundation &middot; The Ever Forward Club &middot; Advocates for Young Men
            &middot; TC Strong, North Carolina
          </p>
          <a href="/events" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Full Calendar and Appearances</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Booking -->
  <section class="section ut-booking-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="ut-booking-inner">
        <div class="ut-booking-text">
          <span class="eyebrow">Booking</span>
          <h2 class="subheadline">Bring Un-Tilted to your community.</h2>
          <p class="body-lg">
            We'll bring the film, the game, and the materials. You bring the room and the kids.
          </p>
          <a href="mailto:hello@ryzo.studio?subject=UN-TILTED%20INQUIRY" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Send an Inquiry</a>
        </div>
        <div class="ut-booking-image">
          <!-- PLACEHOLDER: Photo of materials / setup -->
          <div class="image-placeholder">
            <span>Materials photo</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* ─── Hero ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ut-hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    padding-block: 8rem 5rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ut-hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
  }

  .ut-hero-placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1c0832 0%, #080316 50%, #2d1a4e 100%);
  }

  .ut-hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(8,3,22,0.7) 0%, rgba(8,3,22,0.4) 60%, rgba(8,3,22,0.2) 100%),
      linear-gradient(to top, rgba(8,3,22,0.85) 0%, rgba(8,3,22,0.2) 40%, transparent 70%);
  }

  .ut-hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .ut-hero-content .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .display {
    font-size: clamp(4rem, 12vw, 10rem);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .accent-text { color: var(--accent); }

  .ut-hero-desc {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.2rem);
    color: var(--fg-2);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .ut-hero-stats {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .stat-sep { color: var(--fg-3); }

  /* ─── Shared section bg ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .section {
    background: linear-gradient(to right, #080316 0%, #1c0832 100%);
  }

  /* ─── Image placeholders ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .image-placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--fg-3);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .image-placeholder-wide {
    aspect-ratio: 21 / 9;
    border-radius: 0;
    border-left: none;
    border-right: none;
  }

  .image-placeholder-card {
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg) var(--radius-lg) 0 0;
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  /* ─── What happens in the room ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ut-room-section {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  }

  .ut-room-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .ut-room-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .ut-callout {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* ─── Quotes ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ut-quotes-section {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  }

  .ut-quotes-section .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .ut-quotes-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .ut-quote {
    padding: 2rem;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .ut-quote p {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.15rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--fg);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .ut-quote footer {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--fg-3);
  }

  /* ─── Photo break ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ut-photo-break {
    width: 100%;
  }

  /* ─── Formats ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ut-formats-section {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  }

  .ut-formats-section .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .ut-formats-section .subheadline { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }

  .ut-formats-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .ut-format-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: var(--transition);
  }

  .ut-format-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .ut-format-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--accent);
    padding: 1.5rem 1.5rem 0.5rem;
  }

  .ut-format-card p {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--fg-2);
    line-height: 1.65;
    padding: 0 1.5rem 1.5rem;
  }

  /* ─── Where we've been ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ut-where-section {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  }

  .ut-where-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ut-where-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .ut-venues {
    color: var(--fg-2);
  }

  /* ─── Booking ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ut-booking-section {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  }

  .ut-booking-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ut-booking-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* ─── Responsive ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ut-room-grid,
    .ut-quotes-grid,
    .ut-where-grid,
    .ut-booking-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }
    .ut-formats-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
